#: src/index.js:113
msgid "Used by Native Share, WhatsApp, email, Telegram, X, Bluesky, Threads, and Reddit. Facebook and LinkedIn read the title from the page Open Graph metadata."
msgstr "Uporablja Native Share, WhatsApp, e-pošta, Telegram, X, Bluesky, Threads in Reddit. Facebook in LinkedIn sta prebrala naslov s strani Open Graph metapodatki."

#: src/index.js:114
