#: src/index.js:114
msgid "Used by Native Share, WhatsApp, email, Telegram, X, Bluesky, and Threads. Facebook and LinkedIn do not accept a custom message; Reddit uses only the title and URL."
msgstr "Uporablja Native Share, WhatsApp, e-pošta, Telegram, X, Bluesky in Threads. Facebook in LinkedIn ne sprejemata sporočil po meri; Reddit uporablja samo naslov in URL."

